      "reference_id": "LIT-003",
      "topic": "MATERIAL_MECHANICS_RC",
      "title": "NCHRP Report 549: Simplified Shear Design of Structural Concrete Members",
      "authors": "Neil M. Hawkins; Daniel A. Kuchma (University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign); Robert F. Mast; M. Lee Marsh (Berger/ABAM Engineers); Karl-Heinz Reineck (University of Stuttgart)",
      "year": 2005,
