      "reference_id": "LIT-047",
      "topic": "CONSTRUCTION_FABRICATION_ARCH",
      "title": "B0200 – Super T Girder (bộ bản vẽ tiêu chuẩn đầy đủ B0201–B0217), gồm tờ B0201 \"Standard Sizes – Super T Girder\" và B0203 \"Strand and Reinforcement Details – Sheet B\"",
      "authors": "Roads and Maritime Services (NSW); ký/duyệt: W. Ariyaratne, Director Bridges and Structures",
      "year": 2018,
      "venue": "Transport for NSW / Roads and Maritime Services — Standard Bridge Drawings (Transport Standards Portal)",
