      "authors": "Quynh Chau Truong, Chinh Van Nguyen, Charbel-Pierre El Soueidy, Emilio Bastidas-Arteaga",
      "year": 2023,
      "venue": "ICSCEA 2021, Lecture Notes in Civil Engineering, vol. 268, Springer Singapore, tr. 467–475",
