      "title": "Comparison of Dynamic Amplification Factor of Deflection and Bending Moment of Highway Continuous Box-Girder Bridges by Mode Superposition",
      "authors": "Yelu Wang; Yongjun Zhou; Yang Zhao; Yu Zhao; Yuxin Xue; Wei Feng",
