      "authors": "fib Task Group 5.6 (chủ biên P. Schießl, cùng Bamforth, Baroghel-Bouny, Corley, Faber, Forbes, Gehlen, Helene, Helland, Ishida, Markeset, Nilsson, Rostam, Siemes, Walraven)",
