      "authors": "Dario De Domenico, Davide Messina, Antonino Recupero (University of Messina)",
      "year": 2021,
      "venue": "Materials (MDPI) 14(17):4914, 2021, DOI 10.3390/ma14174914 — Open Access (đọc qua PMC)",
      "doi": "10.3390/ma14174914",
      "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8434466/",
