      "reference_id": "LIT-165",
      "topic": "GEOTECHNICAL_INVESTIGATION",
      "title": "Load and Resistance Factor Design (LRFD) for Deep Foundations (NCHRP Report 507)",
      "authors": "Samuel G. Paikowsky; cùng B. Birgisson, M. McVay, T. Nguyen, C. Kuo, G. Baecher, B. Ayyub, K. Stenersen, K. O'Malley, L. Chernauskas, M. O'Neill",
      "year": 2004,
