      "venue": "Journal of Performance of Constructed Facilities (ASCE), Vol. 17, No. 3, tr. 144–150; DOI theo trang ASCE: 10.1061/(ASCE)0887-3828(2003)17:3(144)",
      "doi": "10.1061/(ASCE)0887-3828(2003)17:3(144)",
